   "quote": "StrucLength (length of MQIIH structure) MQIIH_LENGTH_1 84"
  }
 ],
 "era": 2,
 "notes": "MQFMT_IMS is the name of the MQIIH format; the estate's value 'MQIMS' (padded to 8) is IBM's constant value, which the MQIIH page lists only by name, so the key asserts the layout, not the literal. The copybook field names are the estate's own. MQIIH CommitMode '1' (send then commit) is set by the sender; IBM's initial value is '0'.",
